# PR language per owner (user or org) or per repository. Copy to pr-lang.local
# (gitignored) next to this file; `pr-lang.sh --set <lang> [--for <owner>]`
# writes it for you.
#
# Format: <owner> <lang>  or  <owner>/<repo> <lang>
# - Matching is case-insensitive; a repo line wins over its owner line.
# - Default is en, so list only what differs.
#
# my-org ja
# my-org/legacy-service en
# someone/side-project zh-TW
